    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/6d442f8b17c7142ad67dce7f3e08f956.poster.avif?t=1729930983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/6d442f8b17c7142ad67dce7f3e08f956.webm?t=1729930983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/6d442f8b17c7142ad67dce7f3e08f956.mp4?t=1729930983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/f6093063c821acb31370ad929e5ece01.poster.avif?t=1729930983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/f6093063c821acb31370ad929e5ece01.webm?t=1729930983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/79369f16331ea38e89e7d6de97d22946.poster.avif?t=1729930983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/79369f16331ea38e89e7d6de97d22946.webm?t=1729930983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/79369f16331ea38e89e7d6de97d22946.mp4?t=1729930983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2>You <strong>walk</strong>. Then you <strong>jump</strong>. And then you <strong>fall</strong>. You <strong>throw</strong> the rock. It too, falls. But then you get back up to <i>do it all over again and <strong>again</strong></i>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tough but <strong>VERY</strong> addictive gameplay<br></li><li> Evolving environment - fall back to the previous locations over and over again - discovering something new every time<br></li><li> Failure is progress<br></li><li> Anywhere between 10 and \u221e hours of gameplay<br></li><li> Countless distinct locations<br></li><li> Optional quests<br></li><li> You can throw goats and chickens around<br></li><li> Flick your mouse and dunk<br></li><li> 2.5 endings<br></li><li> makes you <i>feel</i> like Sisyphus</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is SoS?</h2><br><strong><i>Salvation of Sisyphus</i></strong> is a punishing, foddian, climbing (and mostly falling) platformer where your only friend is a pet rock and where failure leads to change. Flick the rock with accuracy. Catch it in the air so it does not fall down. Be careful not to fall yourself. <br>As you progress through this game, you will be able to find your inner peace by embracing negative emotions such as your rage and resentment towards the developer of this frustrating adventure!<br><br>MAY SALVATION COME!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/6d442f8b17c7142ad67dce7f3e08f956.poster.avif?t=1729930983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/6d442f8b17c7142ad67dce7f3e08f956.webm?t=1729930983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/6d442f8b17c7142ad67dce7f3e08f956.mp4?t=1729930983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/f6093063c821acb31370ad929e5ece01.poster.avif?t=1729930983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/f6093063c821acb31370ad929e5ece01.webm?t=1729930983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/79369f16331ea38e89e7d6de97d22946.poster.avif?t=1729930983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/79369f16331ea38e89e7d6de97d22946.webm?t=1729930983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2156790/extras/79369f16331ea38e89e7d6de97d22946.mp4?t=1729930983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2>You <strong>walk</strong>. Then you <strong>jump</strong>. And then you <strong>fall</strong>. You <strong>throw</strong> the rock. It too, falls. But then you get back up to <i>do it all over again and <strong>again</strong></i>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tough but <strong>VERY</strong> addictive gameplay<br></li><li> Evolving environment - fall back to the previous locations over and over again - discovering something new every time<br></li><li> Failure is progress<br></li><li> Anywhere between 10 and \u221e hours of gameplay<br></li><li> Countless distinct locations<br></li><li> Optional quests<br></li><li> You can throw goats and chickens around<br></li><li> Flick your mouse and dunk<br></li><li> 2.5 endings<br></li><li> makes you <i>feel</i> like Sisyphus</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is SoS?</h2><br><strong><i>Salvation of Sisyphus</i></strong> is a punishing, foddian, climbing (and mostly falling) platformer where your only friend is a pet rock and where failure leads to change. Flick the rock with accuracy. Catch it in the air so it does not fall down. Be careful not to fall yourself. <br>As you progress through this game, you will be able to find your inner peace by embracing negative emotions such as your rage and resentment towards the developer of this frustrating adventure!<br><br>MAY SALVATION COME!",
    "short_description": "In this high-stakes, foddian platformer you can finally find out if Sisyphus is happy after all. Equipped with only your pet rock, suffer trials and tribulations - come out a changed person. Join Sisyphus on his journey to salvation and reach the top together! What awaits him there is incredible...",
